            "text": "### 1. Product Identity\nThe application name **Jasper** directly corresponds to the endpoint **jasper.ai**. It serves as the primary domain and web application endpoint for Jasper (legally Jasper Technologies, Inc.), an AI platform designed for enterprise marketing and content operations.\n\n### 2. Product Description\nJasper is an enterprise marketing platform designed to help teams plan, generate, govern, and scale on-brand content across multiple channels. Its primary capabilities include long-form content generation, ad copy creation, campaign coordination, and brand voice alignment using knowledge bases and style guides (Brand IQ). The platform also offers collaborative workspaces (Jasper Canvas), bulk content automation (Jasper Grid), and tools for search and AI engine optimization (GEO and SEO).\n\n### 3. AI Functionality\nAI functionality is central to Jasper’s entire platform and core architecture, rather than an optional add-on. The software relies on large language models and autonomous AI agents to execute multi-step marketing workflows, such as translating content, drafting briefs, generating channel-specific copy, and analyzing competitive positioning. Additional integrated AI tools include Jasper IQ (for ingesting company brand voice, style, and product data to guide generated outputs) and no-code AI app creation via Jasper Studio.\n\n### 4. Alternate Names and Domains\n* **Conversion.ai**: The original name of the product when it launched in January 2021.\n* **Jarvis / Jarvis.ai**: The software rebranded to \"Jarvis\" (and used the domain `jarvis.ai`) later in 2021 before rebranding to Jasper in January 2022 to avoid trademark conflicts with Marvel/Disney.\n* **Jasper AI**: Commonly used informal and trade name for the platform and corporate identity.\n\n### 5. Uncertainty\nThere is no significant ambiguity or conflicting evidence regarding the correspondence between the application name \"Jasper\" and the `jasper.ai` endpoint.",
